  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/xbpDaNBD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QArQ1PH.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>這是我最喜愛的材質包之一，與xali的附魔書材質包並列，它為每種藥水提供了不同的紋理，讓它們更容易區分。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>對於1.21.5之前的版本，您需要使用CIT模組，例如CIT Resewn、Variant CIT或Optifine。對於1.21.5及更高版本，則無需任何額外要求。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>一如既往，祝您使用愉快！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8Kxw9E7ddD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1YnG9UV.png\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/xalixilax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9ACOgFd.png\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fNGhGM8y.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NGhGM8y.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n</blockquote>",
